  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International training workshop on dam safety in cental Asia</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Workshop Zdie&#x13e;anie sk&#xfa;senost&#xed; z&#xa0;oblasti bezpe&#x10d;nosti priehrad 2022</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Presentation and comparison of the current situation in the field of water management in Slovakia and Kazakhstan.&lt;br /&gt;Analysis of shortcomings in legislation and institutional aspects from the perspective of Slovakia&apos;s experience.&lt;br /&gt;Discussion on creation of effective national legislation and specialized organizational structures and proposal of further development and possibilities of cooperation.&lt;br /&gt;Analysis of dam registers, their categorization, appropriate information system, early warning and information system.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">&lt;p&gt;Prezent&#xe1;cia a porovnanie s&#xfa;&#x10d;asnej situ&#xe1;cie v oblasti vodn&#xe9;ho hospod&#xe1;rstva na Slovensku a v Kazachstane. &lt;br /&gt;Anal&#xfd;za nedostatkov v legislat&#xed;ve a in&#x161;titucion&#xe1;lnych aspektoch z poh&#x13e;adu sk&#xfa;senost&#xed; Slovenska.&lt;br /&gt;Diskusia o vytvoren&#xed; efekt&#xed;vnej n&#xe1;rodnej legislat&#xed;vy a &#x161;pecializovan&#xfd;ch organiza&#x10d;n&#xfd;ch &#x161;trukt&#xfa;r a n&#xe1;vrh &#x10f;al&#x161;ieho rozvoja a mo&#x17e;nost&#xed; spolupr&#xe1;ce.&lt;br /&gt;Anal&#xfd;za registra priehrad, ich kategoriz&#xe1;cie, vhodn&#xe9;ho informa&#x10d;n&#xe9;ho syst&#xe9;mu, syst&#xe9;mu v&#x10d;asn&#xe9;ho varovania a informovania.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
  <participating-org ref="XM-DAC-69-2" role="2" type="10">
